      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n## Stable Audio Open 1.0 - text to SFX\n\nGenerate sound effects / short audio samples from a text prompt.\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-open-1.0_repackaged/resolve/main/stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [t5-base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ComfyUI-Wiki/t5-base/resolve/main/t5-base.safetensors)\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 models/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n\u2502   \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 text_encoders/\n\u2502          \u2514\u2500\u2500 t5-base.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_sound.py` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n## Stable Audio Open 1.0 - text to SFX\n\nGenerate sound effects / short audio samples from a text prompt.\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-open-1.0_repackaged/resolve/main/stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [t5-base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ComfyUI-Wiki/t5-base/resolve/main/t5-base.safetensors)\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 models/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n\u2502   \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 text_encoders/\n\u2502          \u2514\u2500\u2500 t5-base.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_sound.py` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      },
